1
00:00:10,360 --> 00:00:12,630
♪Wealth fades away, fame fades away♪

2
00:00:13,640 --> 00:00:16,790
♪All worldly pursuits
are fleeting dreams♪

3
00:00:16,800 --> 00:00:19,350
♪Sorrow fades away,
resentment fades away♪

4
00:00:20,100 --> 00:00:22,870
♪Anger and grudges are
but passing clouds♪

5
00:00:23,480 --> 00:00:26,640
♪Namo Amitabha Buddha♪

6
00:00:26,730 --> 00:00:30,150
♪Namo Amitabha Buddha♪

7
00:00:34,880 --> 00:00:37,230
♪This humble monk wanders freely
across the land♪

8
00:00:38,160 --> 00:00:40,430
♪Laughing and fooling around,
yet bound by karma's law♪

9
00:00:41,240 --> 00:00:43,950
♪People spend their lives chasing
fortune and fearing misfortune♪

10
00:00:44,640 --> 00:00:47,110
♪Yet in a blink, all return to dust♪

11
00:00:47,920 --> 00:00:50,230
♪They scheme endlessly in pursuit
of wealth and glory♪

12
00:00:51,200 --> 00:00:53,580
♪But in the end, all things
simply pass by♪

13
00:00:54,440 --> 00:00:57,350
♪Better to follow the heart
and find true joy♪

14
00:00:57,640 --> 00:01:00,550
♪Don't let worldly troubles
bind your soul♪

15
00:01:00,880 --> 00:01:02,190
♪Walk on, walk on♪

16
00:01:02,560 --> 00:01:03,870
♪Roam on, roam on♪

17
00:01:04,000 --> 00:01:07,430
♪With my worn-out fan in hand,
I care not for worldly woes♪

18
00:01:07,440 --> 00:01:08,750
♪Drink some wine♪

19
00:01:09,120 --> 00:01:10,510
♪Sail the rivers wide♪

20
00:01:10,520 --> 00:01:13,910
♪Simple robes and straw sandals
beat fine silk and fur♪

21
00:01:13,920 --> 00:01:17,070
♪Laugh at my carefree ways, a simple
fan is all I need to chase worries away♪

22
00:01:17,080 --> 00:01:20,470
♪Laugh at my shabby look, a half pot
of wine carries me through the years♪

23
00:01:20,480 --> 00:01:23,750
♪Wine and meat may pass through me,
but kindness stays in my heart♪

24
00:01:23,760 --> 00:01:27,030
♪I cling not to appearances,
finding freedom through Zen's wisdom♪

25
00:01:27,040 --> 00:01:29,070
♪I travel north and south,
witnessing the world's endless tales♪

26
00:01:29,880 --> 00:01:32,540
♪I see life's joys and sorrows
in a single glance♪

27
00:01:33,080 --> 00:01:36,150
♪Those who harm the good and abuse
their power will face their reckoning♪

28
00:01:36,160 --> 00:01:39,630
♪Do good and cultivate virtue,
and worries will fade away♪

29
00:01:39,640 --> 00:01:41,990
♪Don't frown over gains and losses♪

30
00:01:42,240 --> 00:01:45,750
♪True cultivation lies
in a joyful heart♪

31
00:01:46,120 --> 00:01:48,870
♪Let right and wrong, love and hatred
drift away with the wind♪

32
00:01:48,880 --> 00:01:52,990
♪Live freely and wander this world
without restraint♪

33
00:01:53,780 --> 00:01:56,380
=The Mad Monk: Subdue Demons of Dragon's Fall=
=Episode 7=

34
00:01:57,260 --> 00:01:57,900
Oh!

35
00:01:57,900 --> 00:01:58,620
Master!

36
00:01:58,860 --> 00:02:00,180
I remember now.

37
00:02:00,780 --> 00:02:01,620
This woman

38
00:02:01,620 --> 00:02:03,900
was with that monk last time.

39
00:02:04,220 --> 00:02:04,660
Oh.

40
00:02:05,180 --> 00:02:06,820
They must have failed to scam people
for money.

41
00:02:06,980 --> 00:02:08,980
Now they're using the marriage offer
to scam money again.

42
00:02:09,420 --> 00:02:10,580
No wonder this woman

43
00:02:10,580 --> 00:02:12,380
was so eager to demand betrothal gifts.

44
00:02:12,820 --> 00:02:15,020
How outrageous!

45
00:02:15,220 --> 00:02:15,820
Guards!

46
00:02:15,820 --> 00:02:16,460
Report them to the authorities!

47
00:02:17,260 --> 00:02:18,460
(Yamen)
Who is scamming people here?

48
00:02:18,580 --> 00:02:20,540
Wow! You guys are so fast!

49
00:02:20,540 --> 00:02:21,060
Officer.

50
00:02:21,420 --> 00:02:22,660
These three.

51
00:02:22,660 --> 00:02:23,300
Take them away.

52
00:02:24,140 --> 00:02:24,380
Hey!

53
00:02:24,740 --> 00:02:25,460
Hey! Hey!

54
00:02:25,460 --> 00:02:26,420
Wait, wait!

55
00:02:26,420 --> 00:02:26,900
(Yamen)
What are you doing?

56
00:02:26,900 --> 00:02:28,300
I'm innocent!

57
00:02:28,820 --> 00:02:29,700
All right.

58
00:02:30,020 --> 00:02:30,900
Let me ask you this.

59
00:02:31,460 --> 00:02:33,300
Didn't you make me eat your dirt
the other day

60
00:02:33,580 --> 00:02:34,460
and make a temple donation?

61
00:02:34,860 --> 00:02:35,580
And another thing.

62
00:02:36,500 --> 00:02:38,820
A few days ago, you saw
our marriage notice,

63
00:02:39,020 --> 00:02:40,180
so you came here on purpose

64
00:02:40,500 --> 00:02:41,820
to swindle me out
of the betrothal gifts.

65
00:02:42,140 --> 00:02:42,740
Uh...

66
00:02:43,620 --> 00:02:44,140
Well...

67
00:02:44,380 --> 00:02:45,260
Let me tell you.

68
00:02:45,580 --> 00:02:47,380
She made me do all of it.

69
00:02:47,660 --> 00:02:49,340
I want to turn state's witness.

70
00:02:49,500 --> 00:02:50,700
I'll testify against you!

71
00:02:51,420 --> 00:02:52,220
Wow, Master!

72
00:02:52,220 --> 00:02:54,100
You switch sides faster
than you can turn a page!

73
00:02:54,500 --> 00:02:56,620
Exactly! How could you do that?

74
00:02:56,620 --> 00:02:57,300
Take them away!

75
00:02:57,860 --> 00:02:58,380
Wait!

76
00:02:58,780 --> 00:02:59,380
Wait!

77
00:02:59,820 --> 00:03:01,180
Hey, easy! Slow down!

78
00:03:01,340 --> 00:03:01,820
Father!

79
00:03:01,820 --> 00:03:03,060
They're being falsely accused.

80
00:03:03,500 --> 00:03:03,940
Get out of the way!

81
00:03:03,940 --> 00:03:04,900
This has nothing to do with you.

82
00:03:06,220 --> 00:03:07,020
Take them all away!

83
00:03:07,260 --> 00:03:07,860
Father!

84
00:03:08,700 --> 00:03:09,140
I...

85
00:03:10,900 --> 00:03:11,860
I already...

86
00:03:13,060 --> 00:03:14,100
slept

87
00:03:16,180 --> 00:03:17,140
with Die.

88
00:03:21,260 --> 00:03:22,140
Maybe,

89
00:03:22,140 --> 00:03:23,980
she could already be carrying my child.

90
00:03:23,980 --> 00:03:24,780
- What?
- You...

91
00:03:26,900 --> 00:03:27,700
You...

92
00:03:27,860 --> 00:03:29,020
Fine. Let her stay for now.

93
00:03:29,020 --> 00:03:30,500
Take the other two away.

94
00:03:30,980 --> 00:03:31,420
Take them away!

95
00:03:33,220 --> 00:03:33,980
Hey, hey!

96
00:03:33,980 --> 00:03:34,660
Piaopiao!

97
00:03:34,660 --> 00:03:35,180
Holy Monk!

98
00:03:35,180 --> 00:03:36,020
Easy, easy!

99
00:03:36,020 --> 00:03:37,420
Who are you? You evil Taoist!

100
00:03:37,420 --> 00:03:38,460
Why are you framing us?

101
00:03:38,660 --> 00:03:39,540
Mr. Huang.

102
00:03:40,020 --> 00:03:42,540
I'm afraid you won't be
getting that grandson after all.

103
00:03:44,380 --> 00:03:45,260
This woman

104
00:03:45,620 --> 00:03:46,500
is a demon.

105
00:03:46,820 --> 00:03:47,380
By fire, heed my command!

106
00:03:47,380 --> 00:03:47,900
Reveal your true form!

107
00:04:02,180 --> 00:04:03,380
By fire, heed my command!

108
00:04:03,380 --> 00:04:04,100
Seal!

109
00:04:08,740 --> 00:04:09,460
Die!

110
00:04:16,900 --> 00:04:17,700
Taoist Master,

111
00:04:17,700 --> 00:04:19,020
could there be some mistake?

112
00:04:19,020 --> 00:04:19,860
Even if she is a demon,

113
00:04:19,860 --> 00:04:20,620
she's a good one.

114
00:04:20,620 --> 00:04:21,980
Please let my wife go.

115
00:04:22,140 --> 00:04:22,980
Shut up!

116
00:04:23,900 --> 00:04:25,340
You ungrateful son!

117
00:04:25,860 --> 00:04:27,860
You nearly brought ruin
on the Huang family!

118
00:04:28,300 --> 00:04:29,140
Guards!

119
00:04:29,140 --> 00:04:30,980
Take this ungrateful son away!

120
00:04:31,220 --> 00:04:31,940
Father,

121
00:04:32,300 --> 00:04:33,780
please, let my wife go!

122
00:04:37,180 --> 00:04:38,780
Thank you, Taoist Master, for your help.

123
00:04:39,500 --> 00:04:40,700
Allow me to treat you to a feast.

124
00:04:41,020 --> 00:04:41,740
Prepare a banquet!

125
00:04:45,580 --> 00:04:45,980
Master.

126
00:04:45,980 --> 00:04:47,140
Are we really treating him,
or are you just saying that?

127
00:04:47,540 --> 00:04:48,420
You fool!

128
00:04:49,140 --> 00:04:50,700
The Taoist Master has done
our family a great favor.

129
00:04:50,900 --> 00:04:52,180
Do you take me for a stingy man?

130
00:04:52,380 --> 00:04:53,900
Bring out the finest we have!

131
00:04:56,780 --> 00:04:59,740
Two simple vegetarian dishes
will suffice.

132
00:05:00,980 --> 00:05:01,820
Are you deaf?

133
00:05:01,820 --> 00:05:02,540
Go, now!

134
00:05:02,540 --> 00:05:03,620
Yes.

135
00:05:04,340 --> 00:05:05,340
Oh my.

136
00:05:06,220 --> 00:05:06,900
Taoist Master.

137
00:05:07,260 --> 00:05:09,780
Your noble character and virtue
are truly admirable.

138
00:05:10,340 --> 00:05:11,180
Not at all.

139
00:05:11,460 --> 00:05:13,260
I am about to attain immortality.

140
00:05:13,260 --> 00:05:14,340
Money and worldly possessions

141
00:05:15,500 --> 00:05:16,660
mean nothing to me now.

142
00:05:18,900 --> 00:05:21,140
This is an elixir I have refined.

143
00:05:21,140 --> 00:05:24,340
Any mortal who takes just one whiff

144
00:05:24,340 --> 00:05:28,180
will feel refreshed and clear-headed,

145
00:05:28,180 --> 00:05:29,940
and enjoy a longer life.

146
00:05:30,940 --> 00:05:31,420
Oh!

147
00:05:32,020 --> 00:05:32,700
Woah!

148
00:05:33,900 --> 00:05:36,700
I feel so much more energetic already!

149
00:05:36,940 --> 00:05:38,020
And my eyes...

150
00:05:38,380 --> 00:05:40,380
I can see much more clearly than before!

151
00:05:40,740 --> 00:05:42,340
That's nothing.

152
00:05:42,700 --> 00:05:45,340
If a mortal consumes this elixir,

153
00:05:45,740 --> 00:05:48,140
they can become an immortal at once.

154
00:05:48,820 --> 00:05:52,140
Once this demon is absorbed

155
00:05:52,340 --> 00:05:53,620
as the final ingredient,

156
00:05:53,620 --> 00:05:55,340
I shall take this elixir

157
00:05:55,580 --> 00:05:56,420
and immediately

158
00:05:57,220 --> 00:05:58,180
ascend

159
00:05:58,860 --> 00:06:00,260
to the realm of immortals!

160
00:06:00,940 --> 00:06:02,580
Ascend to the immortal realm!

161
00:06:03,420 --> 00:06:04,820
Oh my.

162
00:06:05,580 --> 00:06:07,820
(Silence; Make way)
Order!

163
00:06:07,820 --> 00:06:09,100
Master!

164
00:06:09,100 --> 00:06:11,420
How did you let them capture you?

165
00:06:11,580 --> 00:06:12,180
Well,

166
00:06:12,180 --> 00:06:13,340
I did it on purpose.

167
00:06:13,380 --> 00:06:13,780
Huh?

168
00:06:13,780 --> 00:06:14,980
I want to see

169
00:06:15,260 --> 00:06:17,660
what that Taoist is really up to.

170
00:06:17,660 --> 00:06:19,100
I see.

171
00:06:19,420 --> 00:06:21,340
- So that's why.
- Yes.

172
00:06:22,580 --> 00:06:23,380
Li Xiuyuan,

173
00:06:24,140 --> 00:06:26,180
I've waited a long time for this day.

174
00:06:26,180 --> 00:06:29,860
Today, I will settle the score
with you over my son.

175
00:06:30,260 --> 00:06:31,300
Even if you are an immortal,

176
00:06:31,540 --> 00:06:32,900
(Order: Court Hall)
you ignored the facts

177
00:06:32,900 --> 00:06:34,020
and swindled people out of money.

178
00:06:34,220 --> 00:06:35,460
You cannot escape the law.

179
00:06:36,060 --> 00:06:37,820
Give him fifty lashes!

180
00:06:38,060 --> 00:06:38,620
What?

181
00:06:39,060 --> 00:06:41,020
You corrupt official!
This is clearly revenge!

182
00:06:41,020 --> 00:06:42,340
Forget it.

183
00:06:42,340 --> 00:06:44,420
I have spiritual power protecting me.

184
00:06:44,420 --> 00:06:45,540
No matter how hard they hit me,
it won't hurt.

185
00:06:45,540 --> 00:06:46,580
I'll take a few hits

186
00:06:46,580 --> 00:06:47,900
and let him blow off some steam.

187
00:06:47,900 --> 00:06:49,260
How dare you shout in court!

188
00:06:50,100 --> 00:06:51,180
A disciple breaking the law

189
00:06:51,180 --> 00:06:52,500
is the master's fault.

190
00:06:52,740 --> 00:06:53,260
Guards!

191
00:06:54,020 --> 00:06:55,140
Add another hundred lashes!

192
00:06:57,140 --> 00:06:58,740
So what if I shouted in court?

193
00:06:59,060 --> 00:07:00,020
If you're not tired,

194
00:07:00,020 --> 00:07:00,780
then go ahead and hit him.

195
00:07:01,620 --> 00:07:02,740
You're really not holding back, are you?

196
00:07:03,580 --> 00:07:04,820
Guards, beat him!

197
00:07:04,820 --> 00:07:05,780
All right, all right.

198
00:07:05,780 --> 00:07:06,700
Go ahead, hit me.

199
00:07:07,540 --> 00:07:08,540
Ow, ow!

200
00:07:08,540 --> 00:07:09,660
I know I was wrong!

201
00:07:09,660 --> 00:07:10,860
(Yamen)
Hit me with all you've got!

202
00:07:10,860 --> 00:07:13,060
Let me reform myself properly!

203
00:07:18,900 --> 00:07:20,940
Master, your acting is actually
pretty good!

204
00:07:21,340 --> 00:07:22,300
How could this happen?

205
00:07:22,300 --> 00:07:23,260
Why isn't my spiritual power working?

206
00:07:26,380 --> 00:07:27,540
Hey, hey!

207
00:07:28,020 --> 00:07:29,460
Did you all skip dinner?

208
00:07:29,460 --> 00:07:30,460
Harder!

209
00:07:31,140 --> 00:07:32,780
That's enough!

210
00:07:33,100 --> 00:07:33,700
Ouch!

211
00:07:39,620 --> 00:07:41,060
My precious treasure is still here.

212
00:07:41,780 --> 00:07:43,980
Was it really just an illusion?

213
00:07:49,300 --> 00:07:50,180
The elixir...

214
00:07:51,380 --> 00:07:53,060
If I can become an immortal,

215
00:07:53,620 --> 00:07:55,540
what use would I have for all this gold?

216
00:08:04,780 --> 00:08:05,860
Ow!

217
00:08:08,500 --> 00:08:09,580
Be gentle.

218
00:08:20,100 --> 00:08:20,540
Hey.

219
00:08:21,060 --> 00:08:21,700
Master.

220
00:08:23,620 --> 00:08:24,140
Master.

221
00:08:26,580 --> 00:08:27,180
They are gone.

222
00:08:27,180 --> 00:08:27,860
Master.

223
00:08:30,660 --> 00:08:31,580
Stop sleeping.

224
00:08:31,580 --> 00:08:35,380
Ouch!

225
00:08:35,380 --> 00:08:37,180
It hurts!

226
00:08:38,100 --> 00:08:38,660
Hey.

227
00:08:38,660 --> 00:08:40,220
Stop joking around.

228
00:08:40,220 --> 00:08:41,660
Do I look like I'm joking?

229
00:08:41,660 --> 00:08:42,900
Help me up, quick.

230
00:08:42,900 --> 00:08:44,540
Oh, okay. Here.

231
00:08:45,700 --> 00:08:46,540
Ow, ow...

232
00:08:47,260 --> 00:08:49,020
I don't know why,

233
00:08:49,020 --> 00:08:50,540
but my spiritual power suddenly
vanished completely.

234
00:08:50,540 --> 00:08:51,140
What?

235
00:08:51,140 --> 00:08:52,180
All gone?

236
00:08:52,180 --> 00:08:52,980
Yes.

237
00:08:53,260 --> 00:08:54,180
Then earlier...

238
00:08:55,900 --> 00:08:57,420
- Oh no...
- Don't touch me!

239
00:09:00,300 --> 00:09:01,060
Thunder God.

240
00:09:01,060 --> 00:09:02,100
Dragon-Subduing Arhat.

241
00:09:02,100 --> 00:09:04,380
I brought you some food and wine.

242
00:09:06,020 --> 00:09:07,300
Really sounds like an eunuch.

243
00:09:07,980 --> 00:09:08,260
Hmm.

244
00:09:09,500 --> 00:09:10,020
Oh.

245
00:09:10,980 --> 00:09:11,820
Thank you.

246
00:09:13,860 --> 00:09:14,820
Thunder God,

247
00:09:15,260 --> 00:09:16,540
for some reason,

248
00:09:16,540 --> 00:09:19,460
my powers suddenly
disappeared completely.

249
00:09:19,460 --> 00:09:20,780
Do you know what happened?

250
00:09:20,780 --> 00:09:21,860
Well...

251
00:09:22,060 --> 00:09:23,820
you only have yourself to blame.

252
00:09:23,820 --> 00:09:24,420
What?

253
00:09:24,420 --> 00:09:26,700
You told Li Jing Nezha's secret.

254
00:09:26,700 --> 00:09:27,300
Ah!

255
00:09:27,300 --> 00:09:29,700
Li Jing held that over him.

256
00:09:29,700 --> 00:09:30,060
Huh?

257
00:09:30,260 --> 00:09:31,940
Nezha reported Li Jing to the Empress,

258
00:09:31,940 --> 00:09:33,100
saying that Li Jing

259
00:09:33,100 --> 00:09:34,660
was drinking while on duty.

260
00:09:35,180 --> 00:09:37,340
The Empress wanted to catch him
in the act,

261
00:09:37,340 --> 00:09:38,460
but she didn't expect

262
00:09:38,460 --> 00:09:40,620
to run into the Jade Emperor, Li Jing,

263
00:09:40,620 --> 00:09:42,340
and the newly arrived fairies

264
00:09:42,340 --> 00:09:44,100
having a banquet.

265
00:09:44,100 --> 00:09:45,660
What a mess.

266
00:09:45,660 --> 00:09:46,620
Oh...

267
00:09:48,460 --> 00:09:49,740
Come on!

268
00:09:49,740 --> 00:09:51,500
What does that have to do with me?

269
00:09:51,620 --> 00:09:53,860
The Jade Emperor was stuck,

270
00:09:54,100 --> 00:09:54,980
so he claimed

271
00:09:55,220 --> 00:09:57,340
that you were the one who sent them.

272
00:09:57,340 --> 00:09:58,380
What?

273
00:10:00,820 --> 00:10:02,020
Come on!

274
00:10:02,020 --> 00:10:04,100
I've been at Lingyin Temple the whole
time. I never even went to Heaven.

275
00:10:04,100 --> 00:10:05,780
I'm innocent!

276
00:10:06,940 --> 00:10:09,180
The Empress knows that.

277
00:10:09,180 --> 00:10:10,140
But

278
00:10:10,140 --> 00:10:12,620
she still has to save
the Jade Emperor's face.

279
00:10:12,620 --> 00:10:15,020
And since you're just idling around
in the mortal world,

280
00:10:15,020 --> 00:10:16,620
she took away your powers

281
00:10:17,140 --> 00:10:19,140
to make an example out of you.

282
00:10:19,140 --> 00:10:19,940
What?

283
00:10:22,140 --> 00:10:23,260
Ouch!

284
00:10:24,140 --> 00:10:27,060
I've always been fighting demons

285
00:10:27,060 --> 00:10:28,260
and saving the Three Realms.

286
00:10:28,420 --> 00:10:31,020
Without me, they wouldn't even
have a chance to throw a feast.

287
00:10:31,020 --> 00:10:32,060
Unbelievable!

288
00:10:32,060 --> 00:10:33,340
At least you're a good friend.

289
00:10:33,340 --> 00:10:34,380
You even brought me some wine.

290
00:10:34,540 --> 00:10:35,300
Thanks.

291
00:10:35,300 --> 00:10:35,780
Master.

292
00:10:36,340 --> 00:10:36,940
- Here.
- Okay.

293
00:10:52,540 --> 00:10:53,060
Hey.

294
00:10:54,100 --> 00:10:55,660
What are you doing?

295
00:10:55,660 --> 00:10:57,060
The higher-ups said

296
00:10:57,460 --> 00:10:58,220
you swore that

297
00:10:58,620 --> 00:11:00,820
if you drink, you'll be struck
by thunder.

298
00:11:01,460 --> 00:11:03,260
So they sent me to bring you wine

299
00:11:03,540 --> 00:11:04,580
and take this chance

300
00:11:05,100 --> 00:11:06,700
to silence you.

301
00:11:06,700 --> 00:11:07,980
Huh?

302
00:11:08,860 --> 00:11:11,500
Ouch!

303
00:11:15,380 --> 00:11:16,860
Why did you take out your inner core?

304
00:11:17,300 --> 00:11:17,660
Hmph.

305
00:11:18,220 --> 00:11:20,420
Huang is now richer than a kingdom.

306
00:11:20,900 --> 00:11:22,540
Only the chance to become an immortal

307
00:11:22,540 --> 00:11:23,820
and live forever

308
00:11:24,340 --> 00:11:26,220
can awaken his greed.

309
00:11:27,860 --> 00:11:30,340
He'll definitely try to frame me later

310
00:11:30,740 --> 00:11:32,300
and take my inner core.

311
00:11:32,900 --> 00:11:33,940
But without your inner core,

312
00:11:33,940 --> 00:11:34,780
your powers will be greatly weakened.

313
00:11:34,780 --> 00:11:35,900
Your cultivation will suffer.

314
00:11:37,260 --> 00:11:38,460
He's only a mortal.

315
00:11:39,140 --> 00:11:40,500
Even if he swallows my inner core,

316
00:11:40,500 --> 00:11:42,420
he won't be able to control
the power inside it.

317
00:11:43,540 --> 00:11:45,860
Once he kills his own son
with his own hands

318
00:11:45,860 --> 00:11:47,620
and when his greed reaches its peak,

319
00:11:48,300 --> 00:11:49,700
you take his heart

320
00:11:50,060 --> 00:11:52,660
and use it to save your benefactor.

321
00:11:53,220 --> 00:11:55,340
Then I'll take back my inner core,

322
00:11:55,340 --> 00:11:56,420
and that'll be enough.

323
00:11:56,940 --> 00:11:58,260
Kill his son?

324
00:11:59,260 --> 00:12:00,260
Taoist Master.

325
00:12:00,900 --> 00:12:01,700
He's here.

326
00:12:06,300 --> 00:12:07,060
Taoist Master.

327
00:12:07,180 --> 00:12:08,260
Please enjoy the meal.

328
00:12:11,700 --> 00:12:12,380
Taoist Master.

329
00:12:13,300 --> 00:12:14,620
Allow me to offer you a toast first.

330
00:12:18,500 --> 00:12:19,300
Taoist Master.

331
00:12:19,580 --> 00:12:20,540
Please.

332
00:12:24,660 --> 00:12:26,180
Punishing the wicked
and protecting the innocent

333
00:12:26,300 --> 00:12:28,060
is the duty of Daoists.

334
00:12:28,620 --> 00:12:29,260
Please.

335
00:12:32,820 --> 00:12:33,900
Alas.

336
00:12:33,900 --> 00:12:36,420
You see, I'm just an ordinary mortal,

337
00:12:36,900 --> 00:12:38,780
though I possess great wealth,

338
00:12:39,100 --> 00:12:42,620
I've never seen such
a precious treasure before.

339
00:12:43,060 --> 00:12:43,980
Taoist Master.

340
00:12:44,260 --> 00:12:47,900
Could you let me have another look
at the elixir?

341
00:12:52,540 --> 00:12:53,620
Hmm.

342
00:12:55,060 --> 00:12:56,180
Hey.

343
00:12:57,460 --> 00:12:58,740
You may look,

344
00:12:59,220 --> 00:13:00,260
but don't touch it.

345
00:13:01,380 --> 00:13:02,580
Unless...

346
00:13:03,340 --> 00:13:04,100
I die.

347
00:13:04,740 --> 00:13:05,580
Oh.

348
00:13:05,580 --> 00:13:06,740
Otherwise,

349
00:13:07,260 --> 00:13:09,940
I will never let this elixir
leave my side.

350
00:13:14,740 --> 00:13:15,420
This wine...

351
00:13:17,340 --> 00:13:18,180
Oh...

352
00:13:19,500 --> 00:13:23,140
Once you're dead,
that elixir will be mine.

353
00:13:23,700 --> 00:13:25,900
You actually tricked me!

354
00:13:28,980 --> 00:13:31,380
You only have yourself to blame
for showing off.

355
00:13:31,860 --> 00:13:34,100
Flashing that elixir in front of me
again and again,

356
00:13:34,100 --> 00:13:35,100
over and over.

357
00:13:35,380 --> 00:13:36,740
The chance to become immortal.

358
00:13:37,420 --> 00:13:38,820
Such a perfect opportunity.

359
00:13:41,060 --> 00:13:42,540
How could I possibly let it go?

360
00:13:43,300 --> 00:13:44,500
You are just a mortal.

361
00:13:44,940 --> 00:13:46,660
You can't become an immortal

362
00:13:47,300 --> 00:13:48,020
unless

363
00:13:48,020 --> 00:13:49,740
you use your son's heart

364
00:13:49,740 --> 00:13:51,140
as the final ingredient.

365
00:13:51,740 --> 00:13:53,260
If you want to become a god,

366
00:13:53,620 --> 00:13:55,460
kill your son first.

367
00:14:01,820 --> 00:14:03,020
Lingyu.

368
00:14:04,660 --> 00:14:07,260
You really went to great lengths
to plan this.

369
00:14:08,220 --> 00:14:09,300
Look at

370
00:14:09,940 --> 00:14:11,180
who I really am.

371
00:14:18,620 --> 00:14:21,670
♪My shoes are worn, my hat is torn♪

372
00:14:22,020 --> 00:14:24,870
♪Even my monk's robe is tattered♪

373
00:14:25,000 --> 00:14:28,670
♪Everything I own is worn and weathered♪

374
00:14:28,680 --> 00:14:31,750
♪Yet I laugh and live free as can be♪

375
00:14:32,160 --> 00:14:38,920
♪Namo Amitabha Buddha♪

376
00:14:38,920 --> 00:14:42,470
♪With Buddha dwelling in my heart♪

377
00:14:49,160 --> 00:14:52,390
♪Once, I was known as Li Xiuyuan♪

378
00:14:52,400 --> 00:14:55,630
♪Now I bear the name Ji Dian♪

379
00:14:55,920 --> 00:14:58,950
♪After the wedding,
I became an immortal♪

380
00:14:58,960 --> 00:15:00,630
♪I thought of the Arhat
who subdued the tiger♪

381
00:15:00,640 --> 00:15:02,550
♪And there he was, right by my side,
oh my♪

382
00:15:02,560 --> 00:15:04,110
♪I left my wife behind♪

383
00:15:04,280 --> 00:15:05,710
♪And headed straight to Lingyin Temple♪

384
00:15:05,720 --> 00:15:09,550
♪Living a life of hiding here
and running there♪

385
00:15:09,560 --> 00:15:10,670
♪As long as thunder doesn't strike♪

386
00:15:10,680 --> 00:15:12,790
♪I still dare to make a solemn vow♪

387
00:15:12,800 --> 00:15:14,470
♪With me around, nothing can go wrong♪

388
00:15:14,480 --> 00:15:16,350
♪Waiter, bring me a plate
of chicken wings♪

389
00:15:16,360 --> 00:15:19,710
♪People laugh and say I'm lost
and foolish♪

390
00:15:19,720 --> 00:15:22,990
♪Guangliang always nags and scolds me♪

391
00:15:23,200 --> 00:15:26,110
♪His endless lectures come
from worry I'll cause trouble♪

392
00:15:26,120 --> 00:15:29,470
♪I say Buddha lives within my heart♪

393
00:15:29,480 --> 00:15:33,150
♪Wine and meat may pass through my body♪

394
00:15:33,160 --> 00:15:36,510
♪I wander around, I stroll along♪

395
00:15:36,520 --> 00:15:39,590
♪Leaving all my worries behind♪

396
00:15:40,160 --> 00:15:43,230
♪Take a sip, take a bite♪

397
00:15:43,240 --> 00:15:46,670
♪I don't overthink this life of mine♪

398
00:15:46,680 --> 00:15:50,230
♪You chase fame and fight
over fortune and fate♪

399
00:15:50,240 --> 00:15:53,710
♪You're just wasting your time♪

400
00:15:53,720 --> 00:15:56,670
♪They all call me a Living Buddha♪

401
00:15:56,680 --> 00:15:58,350
♪And I just laugh happily♪

402
00:15:58,360 --> 00:16:01,750
♪Wishing joy and happiness
for all in this world♪

403
